</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=go>drwx------ 2 root root 4096 Jun 20 07:36 l
</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div><p>The new <code>l</code> (lowercase <code>L</code>) directory contains shortened layer identifiers as
symbolic links. These identifiers are used to avoid hitting the page size
limitation on arguments to the <code>mount</code> command.</p><div data-pagefind-ignore x-data x-ref=root class="group mt-2 mb-4 flex w-full scroll-mt-2 flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded bg-gray-50 p-2 outline outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:outline-gray-800"><div class="relative w-full"><div class="syntax-light dark:syntax-dark not-prose w-full"><button x-data="{ code: '', copying: false }" class="top-1
