</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>
</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=go>5ba4f30e5bea: Pull complete
</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=go>9d7d19c9dc56: Pull complete
</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=go>ac6ad7efd0f9: Pull complete
</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=go>e7491a747824: Pull complete
