</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=go>drwx------ 3 root root 4096 Jun 20 16:11 edab9b5e5bf73f2997524eebeac1de4cf9c8b904fa8ad3ec43b3504196aa3801
</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div><p>The image layer directories contain the files unique to that layer as well as
hard links to the data shared with lower layers. This allows for efficient use
of disk space.</p><div data-pagefind-ignore x-data x-ref=root class="group mt-2 mb-4 flex w-full scroll-mt-2 flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded bg-gray-50 p-2 outline outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:outline-gray-800"><div class="relative w-full"><div class="syntax-light dark:syntax-dark not-prose w-full"><button x-data="{ code: '', copying: false }" class="top-1
